n/bot-groups.test.ts."},{"markdown":"Editing a connection under the same ID releases the old view, drafts and requests before displaying the new target. Navigation refreshes its flag and the renderer cannot reuse old group state. Covered by [[src/renderer/src/screens/BotGroups/BotGroups.test.tsx]].","startLine":118,"endLine":118,"text":"Editing a connection under the same ID releases the old view, drafts and requests before displaying the new target. Navigation refreshes its flag and the renderer cannot reuse old group state. Covered by src/renderer/src/screens/BotGroups/BotGroups.test.tsx."},{"markdown":"Selected and unrelated label notifications preserve the selected room and unsent draft when the main-issued private settings revision is unchanged. Rechecking authority cannot silently submit or clear the draft.","startLine":122,"endLine":122,"text":"Selected and unrelated label notifications preserve the selected room and unsent draft when the main-issued private settings revision is unchanged. Rechecking authority cannot silently submit or clear the draft."},{"markdown":"Unknown authority blocks group requests. A changed or failed recapture refuses pending actions and discards old replies; an unchanged revision permits the original request without duplicating its identity.","startLine":126,"endLine":126,"text":"Unknown authority blocks group requests. A changed or failed recapture refuses pending actions and discards old replies; an unchanged revision permits the original request without duplicating its identity."},{"markdown":"A newer capture or connection teardown wakes pending admission without waiting for an obsolete read. Only the latest unchanged private revision may admit the original action; changed targets discard it.","startLine":130,"endLine":130,"text":"A newer capture or connection teardown wakes pending admission without waiting for an obsolete read. Only the latest unchanged private revision may admit the original action; changed targets discard it."},{"markdown":"An explicit retry after a lost creation acknowledgement retains the submitted room ID and payload, so Hermes can return the same durable room without duplicate creation.","startLine":134,"endLine":134,"text":"An explicit retry after a lost creation acknowledgement retains the submitted room ID and payload, so Hermes can return the same durable room without duplicate creation."},{"markdown":"A delayed creation adds its accepted room to the list without replacing a newer deliberate room selection, including a selection that returns to the original room.","startLine":138,"endLine":138,"text":"A delayed creation adds its accepted room to the list without replacing a newer deliberate room selection, including a selection that returns to the original room."},{"markdown":"Late approval, retry and send successes or failures preserve the newly selected room and its unsent draft. Old-room errors cannot replace feedback for the newer selection.","startLine":142,"endLine":142,"text":"Late approval, retry and send successes or failures preserve the newly selected room and its unsent draft. Old-room errors cannot replace feedback for the newer selection."},{"markdown":"Returning or refreshing preserves a later-page selected room, its sidebar summary and draft even when the first page is empty. An explicit Send still targets that room after its exact state is confirmed.","startLine":146,"endLine":146,"text":"Returning or refreshing preserves a later-page selected room, its sidebar summary and draft even when the first page is empty. An explicit Send still targets that room after its exact state is confirmed."},{"markdown":"A failed exact read keeps the unavailable room selected and refuses writes instead of moving its draft to another room. Deliberate navigation remains available, and a later successful read restores its draft.","startLine":150,"endLine":150,"text":"A failed exact read keeps the unavailable room selected and refuses writes instead of moving its draft to another room. Deliberate navigation remains available, and a later successful read restores its draft."},{"markdown":"Accepted creation closes and clears the submitted form even behind Chat, preventing accidental duplicate creation on return. Selecting its room still requires a visible view without a newer deliberate selection.","startLine":154,"endLine":154,"text":"Accepted creation closes and clears the submitted form even behind Chat, preventing accidental duplicate creation on return. Selecting its room still requires a visible view without a newer deliberate selection."},{"markdown":"Name and member controls are disabled while creation is pending, so success cannot discard newer edits. Failed acknowledgement retains the submitted form and stable retry identity while re-enabling its controls.","startLine":158,"endLine":158,"text":"Name and member controls are disabled while creation is pending, so success cannot discard newer edits. Failed acknowledgement retains the submitted form and stable retry identity while re-enabling its controls."},{"markdown":"Group members use the shared Desktop profile-name contract, including existing underscore-prefixed profiles. Picker and main routing preserve names unchanged while validation rejects unsafe paths, uppercase names and overlong values.","startLine":162,"endLine":162,"text":"Group members use the shared Desktop profile-name contract, including existing underscore-prefixed profiles. Picker and main routing preserve names unchanged while validation rejects unsafe paths, uppercase names and overlong values."},{"markdown":"[[src/shared/profile-name.ts#PROFILE_NAME_RE]] is also consumed by Desktop's existing profile-path helpers, keeping group admission aligned without importing main-process modules into the renderer.","startLine":164,"endLine":164,"text":"src/shared/profile-name.ts#PROFILE_NAME_RE is also consumed by Desktop's existing profile-path helpers, keeping group admission aligned without importing main-p